{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9b0be1092d4398103f461dcf713290506f497c4e44129890ecc7d545722a257a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2a1e17889141db67d1f36a4e2cbf40eb34bc0fb3e8443b135b88caa90074c79",
      "text": "喂。你这家伙之前说过，烛光什么的那个\n舞蹈是展现了本大爷全新的一面？对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de6408258a11d9313335c828a536e34ab29b201a3f0993979a6979c3845406ed",
      "text": "昨天，拉面店那家伙也说了同样的话。\n莫名其妙。本大爷只是和平常一样跳而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b29b86273b7e855641649a37fe25c76a52e7680b450b921c472b3e548ac389c7",
      "text": "你这家伙到底懂不懂啊。\n究竟是什么意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ccc5a47a564c00899ae9348f9d11721e07f48be58eb44572b530f7e1b19a5d7",
      "text": "那天晚上的舞蹈非常神秘迷人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3af171bea892f6f66b812d694f96002dfdfb0a82b9d526d3d2a08b51d86c4d16",
      "text": "表情非常新鲜，让我吃了一惊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:592f920aedad4917ed60d4722908479025d21202e4a08231244a091165ba4f84",
      "text": "……？是因为太暗了吗？那种程度的\n暗度，对本大爷来说根本算不了什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56a2375c605ebc4dafc7c8133046aeaef6e636ea3dc5b58693e4f7b6d7a2ede0",
      "text": "就因为那种程度就吓破胆，\n你这家伙也太嫩了！那种情况轻松拿捏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:312862625a205607cf0605881e9cb5361074963367ebea40dc602e7879acee1f",
      "text": "嘛，那个烛光什么的，倒也还算\n有一点点意思就是了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e489803c7fa59693fe15d3d80d3a6955d420b2d39de137ba3398009d9fcf2f5",
      "text": "喂，你这家伙！懂了的话下次也要\n准备配得上本大爷的舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c737a895cc083251b600d19335dc574b2b87e1d5e5ab4bfce762196fce8885f",
      "text": "本大爷的实力可远不止这种程度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:621744e55e79f6c2b8b0df999659cf141f22ada7e8413374fb49647284e186cb",
      "text": "明白了！\n我会期待的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_402_2_4_040_02_09_a:2_4_040_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6387c871c9f5841525c748c530c80b3eecafa0b28342463fdf6be3155b7763f9",
      "text": "咕哈哈！做好觉悟吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
